WEBVTT

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.290
They're already here...

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.150
They're definitely gathering here.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.430
They're coming this way.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:56.740
The battle over there isn't even finished yet.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.770
So all of us and Miwa-chan are next?

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.190
If you're coming, then come.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.450
We'll show you what Tatsumiyajima is capable of!

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.910
Around a dozen enemies approaching.

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:17.660
Several more behind them.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.180
All mechs, prepare to take off.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.550
That's a bad idea right now.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:23.750
If we don't move now, we'll be engulfed.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.190
Attempting to communicate with
the base's control tower.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.950
Our Mir is still alive.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:43.700
Return to nothingness,

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:45.200
Festum!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.970
Even if you destroy us,

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:58.430
hope will live on.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:01.620
It will survive and change the world.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.110
Our Mir is still alive!

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:54.710
Forward! Protect the Esperantos!

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.090
The enemy is heading for the airport!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:05.450
The fleet was defeated.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.540
What do we do, Mitsuhiro?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.220
Do we go to Varca or the airport?

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.930
All air forces, to the airport.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.810
The land forces and I will rendezvous
with the garrison at Varca.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.820
You plan to fight an Azazel-type with them?

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:20.480
We won't be able to beat it, regardless.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.570
We'll save the Esperantos, then retreat
and head to the airport.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.830
We'll fight with you!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.220
I promised Makabe I'd protect them.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.620
Go! We'll join you soon!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.070
We've lost our land and sea routes.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.290
The sky is our only way out.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.560
Go, Ai! We'll see you later!

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:42.800
Understood. I'll be waiting.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.350
So many of them...

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:08.570
Are you there?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.040
You're looking at me, aren't you?!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.540
Come! I am the second-generation Gobain!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.470
The enemy is inside?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.600
They've cut off communication among our
forces and called the Festum here.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.630
But how?

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:38.340
There are Esperantos who
can read people's minds.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:49.550
Contact with the entire Srinagar area is lost.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.610
In this situation, you're telling us not to act?

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.370
That is the order I was given.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.000
You're going to abandon Narain?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.410
That was the Neo United Nations' decision.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.380
Our fleet is preparing for the proclamation.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.880
Proclamation? You don't mean...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.710
We have a unit standing by at the
Polynesian air-strike base.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:15.810
It's likely that headquarters will declare
ROE Alpha on the entire region.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:19.080
Narain is indispensable to the Human Army!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.090
It is unfortunate.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:30.050
Is the job done, Dustin?

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.300
No way to know. We may have to go, as well.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.830
Make sure the mechs are ready.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.740
If the Argos platoon is heading out,

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:41.250
does that mean a base has fallen somewhere?

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.390
Which do we strike?

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.260
The enemy or humans?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:52.260
Our job is eliminating people who have
been assimilated by the enemy, Keith.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:56.270
Along with people who will spread
the damage farther, right?

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.610
Don't take everything on alone. Talk to us.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.430
I told you that there isn't any way to know yet.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:09.390
We try to save assimilated allies,
and even more units are annihilated.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:13.030
I won't allow that to happen again.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.960
You're helping us, when things
are so bad on your side?

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:28.790
You're going to fly? Gutsy decision.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.010
All mechs, help them get out of here!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.970
In the name of Perseus Company,

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.240
we will defend hope!

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.490
Monster...

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.910
This is interceptor unit 1.

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.050
Can anyone hear me?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.440
We'll be arriving in Varca soon.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.660
Someone answer me!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.090
Mitsuhiro?

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:55.950
Walter?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.630
Defense unit 4 is out here?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.460
Does that mean the forest block has fallen?

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.940
Where are you, Walter? I'm heading to you.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.750
Don't! Stay away!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.290
Rescuing the Esperantos takes top priority!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.470
It's here...

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.630
The demon is here.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.980
A Diablo-type...

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.490
They'll all be killed!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.490
Fire!

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.540
I'll kill you! I will kill you!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.100
Run! We'll be surrounded!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.660
What are those mechs doing?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.030
They're possessed.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.870
Their identification codes are functional.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.420
The safety's preventing me from firing!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.770
Enemy has assimilated the
forest block defense unit.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.840
It's a Diablo-type!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.920
But the safety survived?

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.640
What about the mechs' Fenrir?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.930
The command centers have been
taken over. We can't access it.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.950
Delete the mech recognition code.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:48.440
Declare ROE Alpha to all units in combat.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.190
ROE Alpha!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:54.690
ROE Alpha! Roger!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.820
The safety is off.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.320
Be careful to avoid friendly fire.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:12.290
Why are they shooting their allies?

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:16.900
They aren't... They've been assimilated!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.640
There are people inside?

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.420
No sign of enemies in the sky!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.660
Now's our chance... Let's go!

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:50.670
It's trying to enter my mind...

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.550
They can't get out? What do we do?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:07.050
Shoot me! Please!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.810
Before I'm no longer myself...

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.110
Shoot me!

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.290
It won't work! Shoot me!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.780
If I can get the cockpit out...

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.510
Damn bastard!

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.030
They were right.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:04.600
Coming here was a mistake...

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.790
I don't want to die here, away from the island!

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.260
That's right... Hurry.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.120
While I'm still here...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.000
I'm sorry, Mama!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.000
Miwa...

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.250
If I were bigger, I could have done it.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.960
I could have done it much sooner...

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.200
Don't cry. You did the best you could.

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:48.690
If only I could have called them sooner...

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:50.200
It's all right.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.920
See? They're here.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:58.460
Miwa?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.010
Crossing?

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:18.860
Air vehicles approaching!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.050
Their speed is immense!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.870
Receiving message via radio signal.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.340
Read it out loud.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:02.270
The Tatsumiyajima unit

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.280
will join the battle.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.010
I repeat... The Tatsumiyajima
unit will join the battle.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:34.930
D Island's Fafners?

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.820
This is their town?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.820
As predicted, we're in the middle of the enemy.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.720
Did you have peaceful dreams, Kazuki?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.290
I slept well.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.830
It was a nice dream, I think.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.990
Machine code Mark Sein...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.330
It's the real thing!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.000
Mark Nicht...

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:04.840
Soushi-senpai?

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.840
It'll be okay now, Emery.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.760
A power has arrived that even they fear.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.380
Toumi-senpai!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:52.720
It assimilated the enemy and devoured it...

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:56.640
Kazuki-senpai, you really are amazing.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:01.140
Why, Kazuki-kun?

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:06.150
I was told that the dream you all came
here to find might disappear.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.200
I'll protect everyone.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:15.160
I'm pretty sure that's why I'm still alive.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:21.040
This is my blessing!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.330
Kazuki-kun...

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.040
Assimilated mechs?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.550
Nicht would wipe out the
humans along with them.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.630
This one's all yours, Kazuki.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:51.900
I'll try!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:56.910
What is that?

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.140
What?

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.140
What is this?

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.830
Half of them are already gone?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.380
Vitals, zero.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.440
He's dead...

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.380
He's alive! He's alive!

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.110
Half of them survived.

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:04.600
And those that died weren't assimilated.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.270
They've all come back...

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.150
What kind of miracle is this?

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:15.280
Command, the assimilated
mechs are back to normal.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.690
Requesting cancellation of ROE!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:20.170
The power of a miracle?

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.750
Cancelling ROE Alpha!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:26.680
Restoring identification codes and safety.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:30.000
Hurry up with the residential evacuation
and defense line rebuilding!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.300
So this enemy targets the cockpit?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:43.300
And? Is that all?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:57.030
I have the power to assimilate my target, too!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:10.290
A reshaped worm sphere? Interesting...

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:52.370
D Island's existence and the power of nothingness...

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.350
What's going on?

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:08.440
That's right...

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:11.590
That's a Salvator-model.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.900
The power to save humanity that
my father tried to create!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:23.130
He got inside it with all the limiters removed.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:28.650
Kazuki-kun, I'm sorry I couldn't
protect them myself...

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:30.910
I'm sorry.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:34.920
Toumi-senpai...

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:48.230
This type kills the pilot and
takes over the mech, huh?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.930
A mass of hatred and nothingness.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.640
Just like Nicht.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.880
You're there, aren't you, Kazuki?

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:29.140
Yeah. The mech hasn't devoured me yet.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.210
We're done whacking at the swarm.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:32.910
We're taking that one out.

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:36.220
It's a different Azazel-type than
the one pursuing the island.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:40.580
Is it trying to devour this town's Mir?

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.120
Most likely.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.640
Then we'll have to protect it.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:58.210
Our reason for wielding the power
we've acquired will never change.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:01.590
For life. A place to live.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.840
Our pride as humans.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.930
A quiet life.

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:08.760
Because they'll take all that.

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:23.710
Just to keep those things from being stolen,

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:29.480
we devoted our strength to taking
all we could from our enemy.

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:09.250
<i>Fafner in the Azure: Exodus</i>, episode 10:

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:11.110
To the Land of Hope.
